$$

2. Inventory constraint (cannot exceed initial inventory):
$$
x_i \leq s_i, \quad \forall i
$$

3. Non-negativity and integrality:
$$
x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}, \quad \forall i
$$

